<Layouts.app flash={@flash} current_scope={nil} breadcrumbs={@breadcrumbs}>
  <div class="animated-gradient min-h-[calc(100svh-2rem)] px-4 py-10">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-base-300/80 bg-base-100/90 backdrop-blur-md px-6 py-10 shadow-lg sm:px-10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-content mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mb-8">Last updated: April 24, 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/90">
        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">Overview</h2>
          <p>
            This policy describes how Marbles ("we", "us") handles information when you use the website and related services. Replace this page with counsel-reviewed text before production use.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">Information we collect</h2>
          <p>
            If you sign in with Discord, we receive profile identifiers and data made available by Discord under your authorization. We may also collect technical data such as IP address, browser type, and timestamps needed to operate and secure the service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">How we use information</h2>
          <p>
            We use collected information to provide accounts, gameplay features, moderation, analytics, customer support, and legal compliance. We do not sell your personal information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">Retention and security</h2>
          <p>
            We retain data only as long as needed for the purposes above or as required by law. We apply reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect data; no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">Your choices</h2>
          <p>
            You may disconnect Discord or request account deletion where applicable. Contact the operator for privacy requests; response timelines depend on jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content">Changes</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-center text-xs text-base-content/50">
        <.link
          navigate={~p"/"}
          class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-base-content/80 transition-colors"
        >
          Back to home
        </.link>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layouts.app>
